+"""The natural checks of ``scripts/scan_tracked_files.py --natural-texts`` (build plan WP-H; protocol §17.4, decision log
+D47) and their matchers (``tracecontract.natural_privacy``).
+
+The natural tasks here are synthetic: the layout of tests/natural_task_layout.py (NP-90, whose repository's owner is
+masked) and a hand-written NP-91 with an organisation as owner, a base snapshot holding its own package, and texts in
+the forms the checks must read (short comments, a CJK text, a list of short lines, traceback frames). The screening
+texts and AIDev files are synthetic too. Every planted string is synthetic. The last test runs the scan on the
+repository itself against its own natural tasks, where they exist (``data/natural/tasks`` is git-ignored). Not
+research evidence.
+"""
+
